A nice supplement, great quality, 72 words, but with one "the," one "and," and one "s" not a stand-alone pack.  Comes in a nice small metal re-usable box, so nicely portable.

Contains: a*2, an, the; and, but, or, as; always; in, of, to, on, for, with; I*2, me, my, he, she, it, you, your, we, our, us;
be, am, is, are, have, do, feel, like, will, bring*2, make, sing, happen, giggle, laugh, love, give, take, glow;
anything, blue sky (one tile), day, friend, happiness, heart, laughter, rainbow,  smile, sunshine, vibration, warmth;
good, better, brilliant, ecstatic, full, happy, jubilant, positive;
s, ed, er, ing.

